//- ============================================================
//- STEP 2: Add this block to the BOTTOM of each dashboard page
//- Replace 'user' with 'coach' or 'admin' on the respective dashboards
//-
//- For user/student dashboard (views/user/dashboard.pug):
//-   script.
//-     GymSpireTour.init('user');
//-
//- For coach dashboard (views/coach/dashboard.pug):
//-   script.
//-     GymSpireTour.init('coach');
//-
//- For admin dashboard (views/admin/dashboard.pug):
//-   script.
//-     GymSpireTour.init('admin');
//-
//- ============================================================
//- STEP 3: Add data-tour attributes to your HTML elements
//-
//- These are the attributes the tutorial will highlight.
//- Just add   data-tour="<id>"   to the matching element.
//-
//- ── SHARED ──────────────────────────────────
//- Navbar or sidebar dashboard link:
//-   a(href='/dashboard' data-tour='dashboard') Dashboard
//-
//- Profile link:
//-   a(href='/profile' data-tour='profile') Profile
//-
//- Gym congestion section/button:
//-   div(data-tour='congestion') ...
//-
//- Leaderboard section:
//-   div(data-tour='leaderboard') ...
//-
//- ── STUDENT / USER ──────────────────────────
//- Workout Plan card or link:
//-   a(href='/workout-plan' data-tour='workout-plan') Workout Plan
//-
//- Start Workout button:
//-   button(data-tour='start-workout') Start Workout
//-
//- Workout Log link or section:
//-   a(href='/workout-log' data-tour='workout-log') Workout Log
//-
//- PR Tracker section:
//-   div(data-tour='pr-tracker') ...
//-
//- Challenges section:
//-   a(href='/challenges' data-tour='challenges') Challenges
//-
//- ── COACH ───────────────────────────────────
//- Create Challenge button:
//-   button(data-tour='create-challenge') Create Challenge
//-
//- Submissions review section:
//-   div(data-tour='submissions') ...
//-
//- Progress dashboard section:
//-   div(data-tour='progress-dashboard') ...
//-
//- Feedback section:
//-   div(data-tour='feedback') ...
//-
//- ── ADMIN ───────────────────────────────────
//- Manage Accounts link:
//-   a(href='/admin/users' data-tour='manage-accounts') Manage Accounts
//-
//- Import Exercises button:
//-   button(data-tour='import-exercises') Import Exercises
//-
//- Attendance section:
//-   div(data-tour='attendance') ...
//-
//- Settings link:
//-   a(href='/admin/settings' data-tour='settings') Settings
//-
//- ============================================================
//- STEP 4: To RESET the tour for testing (run in browser console):
//-
//-   localStorage.removeItem('gymspire_tour_done_user')
//-   localStorage.removeItem('gymspire_tour_done_coach')
//-   localStorage.removeItem('gymspire_tour_done_admin')
//-
//- Or force show it anytime:
//-   GymSpireTour.start('user')
//-
//- ============================================================


